{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/ce698f1798f26214d6ff813bba1b72dc.avif?t=1766223790\" width=966 height=413 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udea8<strong>A SPACE STATION THAT IS FUNDAMENTALLY BROKEN</strong>\ud83d\udea8</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/3fb766c3864a5aa82bf721230982be64.poster.avif?t=1766223790\" width=560 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/3fb766c3864a5aa82bf721230982be64.webm?t=1766223790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In Space Chaos, you play as agents tasked with managing cargo traffic inside a space station\u2026  <br>that is deeply, fundamentally broken.<br><br>Every day, absurd cargo arrives through unstable portals:<br>radioactive materials, infected or unstable entities,  <br>and objects that leak, contaminate, or randomly teleport players.<br><br><strong>Your job? Send everything to the destination before the station collapses.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/e6462a38888980a99a41980fdf32fe2a.webp?t=1766223790\" width=966 height=27 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udea8<strong>A SIMPLE JOB. DISASTROUS CONSEQUENCES\ud83d\udea8  </strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/b3075e8b190a8e88909f958c29e7b9a6.poster.avif?t=1766223790\" width=560 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/b3075e8b190a8e88909f958c29e7b9a6.webm?t=1766223790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">On paper, it\u2019s easy: Treat Cargo, redirect it.  <br> <br>In reality: <br>one forgotten crate contaminates the entire station,   <br>a portal activated too ealry,    <br>and a gravity failure turns everything into pure chaos. <br> <br><strong>Mistakes don\u2019t disappear. They stack.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/e6462a38888980a99a41980fdf32fe2a.webp?t=1766223790\" width=966 height=27 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udea8<strong>CO-OP\u2026 OR TOTAL MELTDOWN </strong>\ud83d\udea8<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/fbee97c221935bd4e86865c854df1992.poster.avif?t=1766223790\" width=560 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/fbee97c221935bd4e86865c854df1992.webm?t=1766223790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br>Space Chaos is playable  up to 4 players in online co-op. <br> <br>Coordinate under pressure,<br>Try and understand cargo you've never seen before<br>And improvise when everything goes wrong.<br><br>Never underestimate the chaos of space! <br> <br><strong>In Space Chaos, no one survives alone.</strong> <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/e9d68a711257151c1cafbc164ee2b494.poster.avif?t=1766223790\" width=105 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/e9d68a711257151c1cafbc164ee2b494.webm?t=1766223790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2819410?t=1766223790","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766223790","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/c9f4a926b9cf3118b138da5f329f5330fd8c44af/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766223790","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/c9f4a926b9cf3118b138da5f329f5330fd8c44af/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766223790","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4097960,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/ce698f1798f26214d6ff813bba1b72dc.avif?t=1766223790\" width=966 height=413 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udea8<strong>A SPACE STATION THAT IS FUNDAMENTALLY BROKEN</strong>\ud83d\udea8</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.ak